{"seq":2,"slug":"nuts-sampler","title":"NUTS 与自适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/nuts-sampler","wordCount":1368,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"nuts-与自适应\">NUTS 与自适应</h1><p><a href=\"hamiltonian-monte-carlo\">哈密顿蒙特卡洛</a> 强大却挑人：步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 和轨迹步数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 调不好，要么发散、要么白走。2011 年 Hoffman 和 Gelman 的 No-U-Turn Sampler（NUTS）一举把这两个旋钮都自动化了，从此用户几乎不用手调参数。这就是为什么 2026 年的今天，Stan、PyMC、NumPyro、Turing.jl 默认采样器全是 NUTS。这一篇讲它的两大机关：用「U 形掉头」判据自动定轨迹长度，用对偶平均自动定步长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NUTS 解决 HMC 的核心矛盾：轨迹太短走不远，太长又会兜回起点附近浪费算力。它的洞察是——<strong>与其预设步数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，不如让轨迹自己决定何时停</strong>。NUTS 从当前点出发，向前向后<strong>双向</strong>倍增式地构建一棵二叉轨迹树：先走 1 步，再 2 步、4 步、8 步……每次倍增，直到检测到轨迹开始「掉头」（U-turn），即继续走只会让位置离起点更近而非更远。停下后，从整条轨迹上按一个保证细致平衡的规则随机挑一个点作为下一个样本。这样轨迹长度因地制宜，地形平缓处走得长、陡峭处走得短，全自动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[当前点 q, 随机动量 p] --&gt; B[初始化轨迹树 深度 0]&#10;  B --&gt; C[向前或向后倍增&lt;br/&gt;2^j 步 leapfrog]&#10;  C --&gt; D{检测 U-turn?&lt;br/&gt;轨迹开始掉头}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[深度 +1, 继续倍增]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt;|是, 或触发发散| F[停止扩展]&#10;  F --&gt; G[沿整树按多项式规则&lt;br/&gt;随机抽一点为下一样本]&#10;  G --&gt; H[warmup 期: 对偶平均更新 ε&lt;br/&gt;与质量矩阵 M]\">flowchart TD\n  A[当前点 q, 随机动量 p] --&gt; B[初始化轨迹树 深度 0]\n  B --&gt; C[向前或向后倍增&lt;br/&gt;2^j 步 leapfrog]\n  C --&gt; D{检测 U-turn?&lt;br/&gt;轨迹开始掉头}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[深度 +1, 继续倍增]\n  E --&gt; C\n  D --&gt;|是, 或触发发散| F[停止扩展]\n  F --&gt; G[沿整树按多项式规则&lt;br/&gt;随机抽一点为下一样本]\n  G --&gt; H[warmup 期: 对偶平均更新 ε&lt;br/&gt;与质量矩阵 M]</pre><h2 id=\"它与固定-l-的-hmc-差在哪\">它与固定 L 的 HMC 差在哪</h2><p>把 NUTS 和「手调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的 HMC」并排，差别集中在三点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"HMC（固定 L）:&#10;    p ~ N(0, M)&#10;    (q*, p*) = leapfrog(q, p, L 步)      # L 由用户预先给定&#10;    accept with min(1, exp(-ΔH))&#10;&#10;NUTS（自终止）:&#10;    p ~ N(0, M)&#10;    tree = 从 q 出发双向倍增建平衡二叉树&#10;    while not U-turn(tree) and depth &lt; max_treedepth:&#10;        扩展一层, 每层 2^j 步 leapfrog&#10;    从整棵树上按多项式规则随机抽一点为下一样本   # 保证细致平衡\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HMC（固定 L）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p ~ N(0, M)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (q*, p*) = leapfrog(q, p, L 步)      # L 由用户预先给定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    accept with min(1, exp(-ΔH))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>NUTS（自终止）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    p ~ N(0, M)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tree = 从 q 出发双向倍增建平衡二叉树</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while not U-turn(tree) and depth &#x3C; max_treedepth:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        扩展一层, 每层 2^j 步 leapfrog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    从整棵树上按多项式规则随机抽一点为下一样本   # 保证细致平衡</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键差异有两处必须点明。其一，HMC 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>先验设定</strong>的常数，地形平缓处白走、陡峭处走不够；NUTS 让轨迹<strong>自己</strong>用 U-turn 判据喊停，长度因地制宜。其二，停止规则不能随便定——若简单地「遇到 U-turn 就取最后一点」，会破坏细致平衡；NUTS 用平衡二叉树的递归构建加多项式抽样，才在自适应长度的同时保住正确性，这也是它比「跑 HMC 再手动截断」更可靠的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"u-turn-判据-轨迹自己喊停\">U-turn 判据：轨迹自己喊停</h2><p>NUTS 怎么知道该停？它监测轨迹两端的「分离趋势」。设轨迹最左端位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{q}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、动量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最右端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{q}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>或</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\mathbf{q}^+ - \\mathbf{q}^-)\\cdot \\mathbf{p}^- &lt; 0 \\quad\\text{或}\\quad (\\mathbf{q}^+ - \\mathbf{q}^-)\\cdot \\mathbf{p}^+ &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0713em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>就意味着两端的运动方向已经指向彼此、轨迹正在回卷，继续走只会绕回——此时停止。这个判据让轨迹长度自适应于局部几何，无需用户给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>。为了在双向倍增中保持细致平衡，NUTS 用递归（Stan）或迭代（NumPyro，对 JAX 的 JIT 更友好）方式构建平衡二叉树，并在树深超过上限（<code>max_treedepth</code>，默认 10）时强制停止——<strong>频繁触顶是个警告</strong>，说明步长太小、轨迹被截断，效率受损。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对偶平均-步长-自动整定\">对偶平均：步长 ε 自动整定</h2><p>轨迹长度搞定了，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 还得定。NUTS 在 <strong>warmup（预热）阶段</strong> 用 <strong>dual averaging（对偶平均，Nesterov）</strong> 自动调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，把接受统计量推向一个目标值（HMC/NUTS 常用目标接受率 <code>target_accept</code>，默认约 0.8）。机制是：观测到的接受率偏高就增大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>、偏低就减小，对偶平均保证这个随机迭代稳定收敛而不来回震荡。同时 warmup 还估计<strong>质量矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（HMC 动能里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，相当于预条件子），用样本协方差让动量适配各参数的尺度——这呼应了 <a href=\"../samplers/proposal-design\">提议分布设计</a> 里「自适应只在 warmup 做、采样期冻结」的原则，从而绕开自适应破坏马氏性的陷阱。warmup 结束后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 固定，正式采样开始。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>自动整定项</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>用户旋钮</th>\n<th>出问题的信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对偶平均逼近目标接受率</td>\n<td><code>target_accept</code>（默认 ~0.8）</td>\n<td>发散点多 → 调高到 0.9–0.99</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轨迹长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>U-turn 判据动态决定</td>\n<td><code>max_treedepth</code>（默认 10）</td>\n<td>频繁触顶 → 模型或步长有问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>warmup 期样本协方差</td>\n<td>warmup 步数</td>\n<td>后验强相关 → 考虑重参数化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调高-target_accept-治发散-不是万灵药\">调高 target_accept 治发散，不是万灵药</h2><p>实践中最常见的 NUTS 报错是「出现发散点」（divergences）。发散意味着 leapfrog 在某处数值失稳、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 爆掉，往往是后验有病态几何（如层次模型的<strong>漏斗形</strong>：方差参数小时，相关参数被挤进极窄的脖颈）。第一反应通常是把 <code>target_accept</code> 从 0.8 调到 0.9、0.95 甚至 0.99——这会迫使对偶平均选更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>、走更细的步，减少发散。但要清醒：<strong>调高 target_accept 只是治标</strong>，它让步子更细从而更慢；真正的根治是改后验几何本身，即重参数化（中心化↔非中心化），把漏斗「掰直」。发散落在哪些参数附近，是诊断病态几何的关键线索——这套读图与重参数化的功夫，交给 <a href=\"../practice/convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a> 和 <a href=\"../practice/mixing-tuning\">混合与调优</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NUTS 自动化了 HMC 的两个难调旋钮，是 Stan/PyMC/NumPyro/Turing.jl 的默认采样器。</li>\n<li>轨迹长度由 U-turn 判据动态决定，双向倍增建树，<code>max_treedepth</code> 封顶。</li>\n<li>步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 与质量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在 warmup 期由对偶平均整定，目标接受率默认约 0.8，采样期冻结。</li>\n<li>发散点是病态几何的红旗；调高 <code>target_accept</code> 治标，重参数化才治本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"hamiltonian-monte-carlo\">哈密顿蒙特卡洛</a>——NUTS 自动化的对象；<a href=\"../practice/convergence-diagnostics\">收敛诊断</a>——读懂发散与树深警告；<a href=\"../practice/mixing-tuning\">混合与调优</a>——重参数化根治漏斗。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../optimization-theory/modern-optimization/adam-optimizer\">Adam 优化器</a> 的自适应步长与对偶平均同属「自动调学习率」家族；<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/statistical-inference/maximum-likelihood\">最大似然估计</a> 是后验众数的频率派对照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"NUTS 与自适应","id":"nuts-与自适应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"它与固定 L 的 HMC 差在哪","id":"它与固定-l-的-hmc-差在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"U-turn 判据：轨迹自己喊停","id":"u-turn-判据-轨迹自己喊停"},{"level":2,"text":"对偶平均：步长 ε 自动整定","id":"对偶平均-步长-自动整定"},{"level":2,"text":"调高 target_accept 治发散，不是万灵药","id":"调高-target_accept-治发散-不是万灵药"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"哈密顿蒙特卡洛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/hamiltonian-monte-carlo"},"next":{"title":"MCMC 与变分推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/modern/mcmc-vs-variational"}}